        "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 25 2022 18:38:06 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Exeter</span></span></p>\n<p>The Exeter cemented femoral hip system is designed for surgeons who are looking to perform all hip indications - primary, revision and fracture - with a single proven system.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/joint-replacement/products/exeter.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn More</span></a></span></p>\n",
