        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Trident II</span></span></p>\n<p>Have confidence in a powerful combination–a system that builds on the legacy that has defined our Trident brand for more than two decades, paired with the latest additive manufactured Tritanium In-Growth Technology or PureFix HA.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/joint-replacement/products/trident-ii.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn More</span></a></span></p>\n",
