        "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 25 2022 18:38:06 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Modular Dual Mobility</span></span></p>\n<p>Modular Dual Mobility is a premium acetabular offering designed to help prevent dislocation. The system builds upon our Anatomic Dual Mobility offering by providing you a choice of fixation surfaces and screwhole configurations for primary or revision THA.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/joint-replacement/products/modular-dual-mobility.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn More</span></a></span></p>\n",
